      "marks": 1,
      "negativeMarks": 0.33,
      "explanation": "<div class='space-y-2'><p><strong>Step-by-Step Solution (Control Systems):</strong></p><p>For a Type-1 system with unit ramp input: velocity error constant $K_v = \\lim_{s \\to 0} s G(s)$, and steady-state error $e_{ss} = \\frac{1}{K_v}$.</p></div>"
